atures</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"passives\" data-item-name=\"passives\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Brave\" title=\"Brave\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Brave_Icon.webp/25px-Brave_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Brave_Icon.webp/38px-Brave_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Brave_Icon.webp/50px-Brave_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Brave\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Brave_Icon.webp/25px-Brave_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Brave_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Brave\" title=\"Brave\"><b>Brave</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">saving throws</a> against <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Frightened\">frightened</a>.</p></div></div></li><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halfling_Luck\" title=\"Halfling Luck\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp/25px-Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp/38px-Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp/50px-Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Halfling Luck\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp/25px-Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Halfling_Luck_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Halfling_Luck\" title=\"Halfling Luck\"><b>Halfling Luck</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>When rolling a 1 on an <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack roll</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">ability check</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">saving throw</a>, rerolls once and uses the new result.</p></div></div></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Technical</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>S_EPI_TerrifiedThief</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_EPI_TerrifiedThief+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_EPI_TerrifiedThief+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uuid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UUID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>85d6a92c-dc66-4f26-b6b7-1feb8301fa4c</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:85d6a92c-dc66-4f26-b6b7-1feb8301fa4c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:85d6a92c-dc66-4f26-b6b7-1feb8301fa4c\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stats\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">Stats</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>Halfling_Melee</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Halfling_Melee+type:statscharacter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Halfling_Melee+type:statscharacter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n<b>Happy Hoarson</b> is an NPC in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>. He's found at the party site during the <a href=\"/wiki/Epilogue\" title=\"Epilogue\">Epilogue</a>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Epilogue\">Epilogue</span></h3>\n<p>Happy was caught stealing from the battlesite of the Battle for Baldur's Gate by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/25px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/38px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/50px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minsc\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png/25px-Portrait_Minsc.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Portrait_Minsc.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\">Minsc</a>. Minsc held him over the edge of <a href=\"/wiki/High_Hall\" title=\"High Hall\">High Hall</a> for over 2 hours, until they both were transported to Withers' party.\n</p><p>When initially speaking to Happy, conversation begins with Minsc instead. Minsc berates Happy for being a scoundrel who does not deserve to be in the presence of so many heroes. Still, the Rashemaan believes Happy could make better of himself, but ultimately it is up to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boo\" title=\"Boo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Portrait_Boo.png/25px-Portrait_Boo.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Portrait_Boo.png/38px-Portrait_Boo.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Portrait_Boo.png/50px-Portrait_Boo.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Boo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Portrait_Boo.png/25px-Portrait_Boo.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Portrait_Boo.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Boo\" title=\"Boo\">Boo</a> whether he lives or dies.\n</p><p>When spoken to again, Happy quivers in fear of Boo.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234442\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]